WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.820
In 1492, the rulers of Spain ordered
every Jew in their kingdoms to convert or

2
00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:06.960
leave.

3
00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:12.110
Many left, and an Ottoman sultan allowed
refugees to settle in his empire.

4
00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:14.780
For centuries, Jews had lived in Baghdad,

5
00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:18.400
Cairo and Mainz, under
very different rulers.

6
00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:21.610
So how did scattered
communities keep one faith,

7
00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:24.680
under rulers who welcomed
or expelled them?

8
00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:29.520
In this mission, you'll learn what Jews
believe about one God and the covenant.

9
00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:33.410
Then you'll compare Jewish life
under Muslim and Christian rulers,

10
00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:35.870
from protection to expulsion.

11
00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:40.250
Your mission: find out how scattered
communities kept one faith,

12
00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.840
and why rulers treated
them so differently.
